			"name": "Machine Learning: Algorithms That Learn",
			"truth": "Learning is optimization in a landscape you can't fully see.",
			"qfep_term": "Integration",
			"qfep_connection": "ML systems navigate F\u00e2\u2020\u201dE by descending loss landscapes. Gradient descent IS the oscillation between order (model) and entropy (data). Overfitting is F-collapse; underfitting is E-dominance.",
			"description": "From evolving creatures to neural networks \u00e2\u20ac\u201d algorithms that adapt. Three arcs: evolution (selection pressure shapes form), perception (learning to classify and compress), generation (machines that make new things).",
